WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.312
Cubosomes contain structured internal lipid domains.

00:00:04.312 --> 00:00:08.143
Their morphology is intriguing, but drug delivery is

00:00:08.143 --> 00:00:08.364
not

00:00:08.364 --> 00:00:10.245
secured by geometry alone.

00:00:16.217 --> 00:00:19.292
Theranostics links therapeutic and diagnostic

00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:19.975
ambitions.

00:00:19.975 --> 00:00:23.466
These are distinct performance claims with different

00:00:23.466 --> 00:00:24.674
measurement needs.

00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:33.769
Lipid composition, loading and surrounding biological

00:00:33.769 --> 00:00:37.499
fluids affect the practical behaviour of a nanoscale

00:00:37.499 --> 00:00:38.073
carrier.

00:00:43.175 --> 00:00:46.983
A ligand or proposed uptake mechanism does not alone

00:00:46.983 --> 00:00:50.352
demonstrate selective tumour delivery in vivo.

00:00:55.008 --> 00:00:59.021
Stability, biodistribution, safety and reproducibility

00:00:59.021 --> 00:01:02.885
determine whether a promising system can move toward

00:01:02.885 --> 00:01:04.372
clinical evaluation.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:13.732
The forthcoming accepted chapter critically discusses

00:01:13.732 --> 00:01:17.464
cancer-targeted cubosome design and the difficult path

00:01:17.464 --> 00:01:17.602
to

00:01:17.602 --> 00:01:19.027
clinical translation.
